' TFEX handoff auto-refresh - copy this file into
'   %APPDATA%\Microsoft\Windows\Start Menu\Programs\Startup\
' and fix the two paths below. It starts at logon and refreshes docs/HANDOFF.md
' every 3 hours while the machine stays on; deleting the copy stops it.
' Keep the file ASCII only and without a BOM - the VBScript engine rejects both.
Set sh = CreateObject("WScript.Shell")
sh.CurrentDirectory = "C:\path\to\tfex-common"
sh.Run """C:\path\to\pythonw.exe"" ""C:\path\to\tfex-common\scripts\handoff_refresh_loop.py""", 0, False
